('wikiloc', '67320530', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/cims-de-rocacorba-golany-espinassors-turo-rodo-rocacorba-puigsesarques-i-comaestremer-67320530', 'Peaks of Rocacorba, Golany, Espinassors, Turó Rodó, Rocacorba, Puigsesarques and Comaestremer', '{"en":"Rocacorba area loop from Sant Nicolau","ca":"Circular zona Rocacorba des de Sant Nicolau","es":"Circular zona Rocacorba desde Sant Nicolau"}'::jsonb, 'Cims de Rocacorba, Golany, Espinassors, Turó Rodó, Rocacorba, Puigsesarques i Comaestremer Hiking trail in Falgons, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Ruta circular amb sortida del pla de Sant Nicolau per fer alguns del cims del voltant de Rocacorba: Golany, Espinassors, Turó Rodó, Rocacorba, Puigsesarques, Comaestremer.', '{"en":"This moderate 10.2 km loop, with 559 m of elevation gain, starts from Pla de Sant Nicolau and explores several peaks around Rocacorba. The route includes ascents to Golany, Espinassors, Turó Rodó, Rocacorba, Puigsesarques, and Comaestremer.\n\nThis circuit offers a comprehensive tour of the area''s summits, providing a good challenge for hikers seeking multiple peak bagging in a single day. The trail is well-suited for those familiar with moderate mountain terrain.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 10,2 km, amb 559 m de desnivell positiu, comença des del Pla de Sant Nicolau i explora diversos cims al voltant de Rocacorba. El recorregut inclou ascensions al Golany, Espinassors, Turó Rodó, Rocacorba, Puigsesarques i Comaestremer.\n\nAquest circuit ofereix un recorregut complet pels cims de la zona, proporcionant un bon repte per als excursionistes que busquen coronar múltiples cims en un sol dia. El sender és adequat per a aquells familiaritzats amb terreny de muntanya moderat.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 10,2 km, con 559 m de desnivel positivo, comienza desde el Pla de Sant Nicolau y explora varios picos alrededor de Rocacorba. El recorrido incluye ascensos a Golany, Espinassors, Turó Rodó, Rocacorba, Puigsesarques y Comaestremer.\n\nEste circuito ofrece un recorrido completo por las cumbres de la zona, proporcionando un buen desafío para los excursionistas que buscan coronar múltiples picos en un solo día. El sendero es adecuado para aquellos familiarizados con terreno de montaña moderado."}'::jsonb, 'peraurich', 10235, 559, 559, 919, 715, 'moderate', 'loop', 7860, 10380, 1759, '2021-03-06', '2021-02', '[{"lat":42.086104,"lng":2.683649,"ele":724.3},{"lat":42.086075,"lng":2.68359,"ele":725.1},{"lat":42.086069,"lng":2.683494,"ele":724.9},{"lat":42.086055,"lng":2.683425,"ele":725.9},{"lat":42.086065,"lng":2.683366,"ele":726.9},{"lat":42.086032,"lng":2.6833,"ele":727.7},{"lat":42.085987,"lng":2.68327,"ele":727},{"lat":42.08595,"lng":2.683228,"ele":726.9},{"lat":42.085941,"lng":2.683162,"ele":728.7},{"lat":42.085941,"lng":2.683091,"ele":729.6},{"lat":42.085903,"lng":2.683039,"ele":730.9},{"lat":42.085882,"lng":2.682983,"ele":731},{"lat":42.085896,"lng":2.682917,"ele":732.1},{"lat":42.085876,"lng":2.68286,"ele":732.7},{"lat":42.085878,"lng":2.682788,"ele":732.1},{"lat":42.085846,"lng":2.682727,"ele":731.2},{"lat":42.085801,"lng":2.682696,"ele":729.9},{"lat":42.08577,"lng":2.682651,"ele":729.6},{"lat":42.085756,"lng":2.682588,"ele":730},{"lat":42.085778,"lng":2.682515,"ele":729.9},{"lat":42.085756,"lng":2.682436,"ele":728.3},{"lat":42.085712,"lng":2.682387,"ele":728.8},{"lat":42.085667,"lng":2.682347,"ele":729.8},{"lat":42.085607,"lng":2.682322,"ele":730.6},{"lat":42.08555,"lng":2.682315,"ele":730.8},{"lat":42.085608,"lng":2.682296,"ele":732},{"lat":42.085658,"lng":2.682285,"ele":732.1},{"lat":42.085702,"lng":2.682264,"ele":733.3},{"lat":42.085735,"lng":2.682217,"ele":734.2},{"lat":42.085776,"lng":2.682171,"ele":736.3},{"lat":42.085825,"lng":2.682108,"ele":737.5},{"lat":42.085875,"lng":2.682095,"ele":737.8},{"lat":42.085929,"lng":2.682064,"ele":738.1},{"lat":42.085976,"lng":2.682039,"ele":739.1},{"lat":42.086022,"lng":2.68204,"ele":740.6},{